{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Geometry Arena 2</strong> distills RPG depth and Roguelite elements into a loop of <strong>Meta-Progression &amp; Endless Challenges</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match Weapons, Bodies, Modules, and Pets to craft your game-breaking builds! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meta-Progression: A Progression system balancing Fun and Power</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free Combination: 10+ Weapons &amp; Bodies and 90+ Modules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random Pets: Powerful and reliable partners in various shapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom Difficulty:\u00a0Customize 20+ Challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Challenges: Evolve with 200+ Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep Gameplay: Hardcore RPG stats system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense Combat: Smash the surging enemy waves into fragments!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart Assistant: Geo Assistant, free your hands!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Minimalist lines, vibrant colors!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety, Freedom, and Infinity\u00a0are the core pillars\u00a0of the\u00a0<i>Geometry Arena</i> series. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quick stress-relief run, or a deep dive for dozens of hours\u2014welcome to Geometry Arena 2.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Junior Defender","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1667700/4b619fbcfd31a1220af63266525a530eba7e7270.jpg"},{"name":"Senior Defender","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1667700/e3c4794380a73ad25c39ab8a58dd5df0cb3cbc95.jpg"},{"name":"Expert Defender","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1667700/e4020f7148f8d5b27451fb5d192da8b35a371d0e.jpg"},{"name":"Master Defender","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1667700/f493ff670f47cba6d8df4d3ac88cb4263d83a175.jpg"},{"name":"Junior Tracker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1667700/ea45ae5348bb1e43b0835fba118513448aebfdc8.jpg"},{"name":"Senior Tracker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1667700/c64bdad35124a6856f516335e466e798f2eb0be5.jpg"},{"name":"Expert Tracker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1667700/224b2dff51cf6e74af832e062d155358e043fd75.jpg"},{"name":"Master Tracker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1667700/752bf397cfa72f22f3923ac34cabf3911859fd59.jpg"},{"name":"Junior Revolver","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1667700/1a477d122f3e2a4d5621cd496082aaa8ad1a11ed.jpg"},{"name":"Senior Revolver","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1667700/b6e2c11ff33e9bce044a3fd90a4e1c82c037f823.jpg"}],"total":139},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1667700?t=1768727650","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1667700/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768727650","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1667700/71f03065ff9c1abbda6587f020265729ab46a4e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768727650","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1667700/71f03065ff9c1abbda6587f020265729ab46a4e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768727650","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>A Note from the Developer</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello everyone! Geometry Arena 2 is the second game in my indie dev journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built upon the foundation of its predecessor, this sequel aims to make up for past imperfections and deliver a fully evolved experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a solo developer with limited resources, I may not be able to create a flawless game, but I will do my absolute best to grow alongside my players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to leave suggestions in the Steam Community or Reviews, or contact me directly via Steam Chat or Discord!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I read every review, stay transparent, and answer every question.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Please find community links on the right sidebar.)</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Geometry Arena 2</strong> distills RPG depth and Roguelite elements into a loop of <strong>Meta-Progression &amp; Endless Challenges</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match Weapons, Bodies, Modules, and Pets to craft your game-breaking builds! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meta-Progression: A Progression system balancing Fun and Power</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free Combination: 10+ Weapons &amp; Bodies and 90+ Modules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random Pets: Powerful and reliable partners in various shapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom Difficulty:\u00a0Customize 20+ Challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Challenges: Evolve with 200+ Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep Gameplay: Hardcore RPG stats system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense Combat: Smash the surging enemy waves into fragments!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart Assistant: Geo Assistant, free your hands!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Minimalist lines, vibrant colors!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety, Freedom, and Infinity\u00a0are the core pillars\u00a0of the\u00a0<i>Geometry Arena</i> series. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quick stress-relief run, or a deep dive for dozens of hours\u2014welcome to Geometry Arena 2.</p>","developers":["011 Games"],"dlc":[2805050],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1667700/8fb06d562fb24edbb4cc65c3d7539da759489693/header.jpg?t=1768727650","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1667700/1830428949/0c2fc3e20568f7bc8fc989009805d1498e74fed8/1768556781/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768559033","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1667700/1830428949/0c2fc3e20568f7bc8fc989009805d1498e74fed8/1768556781/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768559033","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1667700/1830428949/0c2fc3e20568f7bc8fc989009805d1498e74fed8/1768556781/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768559033","id":257266127,"name":"1.0 Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257266127/6d19e702562f8105e8cab0918e9b4c1b8981a339/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1768559033"}],"name":"Geometry Arena 2","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"de